%% model: gemini_3_8_flash
%% prompt: 10. Quality control at a small coffee roastery (prompts.md)
flowchart LR
    Start([Receive Green Beans]) --> Intake[Green-Bean Intake]
    Intake --> Inspect{Lot Inspection}
    Inspect -- Fail --> RejectLot[Reject Lot and Return]
    Inspect -- Pass --> SampleRoast[Sample Roasting]

    SampleRoast --> Rest[Bean Resting]
    Rest --> Cup[Cupping Evaluation]

    Cup --> CupDecision{Cupping Quality}
    CupDecision -- Unsatisfactory --> RecipeAdj[Recipe Adjustment]
    RecipeAdj --> SampleRoast

    CupDecision -- Satisfactory --> ProdRoast[Production Roasting]

    SampleRoast -.-> Log[Record Batch Log: Settings and Notes]
    Cup -.-> Log
    RecipeAdj -.-> Log
    ProdRoast -.-> Log

    ProdRoast --> ProdQC{Production QC}

    ProdQC -- Approved --> Packaging[Packaging]
    ProdQC -- Hold --> Investigate[Hold for Investigation]
    ProdQC -- Rejected --> Discard[Reject and Discard Batch]

    Packaging --> Sale([Approved for Sale])
    Investigate --> Recheck{Investigation Outcome}
    Recheck -- Pass --> Packaging
    Recheck -- Fail --> Discard
